 wave\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"were calculated as the sum of weekly cases divided by the weekly patient census during each wave.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"The rates by wave, with 95% CIs, were calculated and stratified by rural-urban continuum code,\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Age group–stratified COVID-19 rates among the U.S. population (cases per 10,000 population) were calculated as the total number of cases\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\", \"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}